Adapt RDO's rpm-master python-oslo-privsep.spec to the released 2026.1 tarball
(oslo.privsep 3.10.1).

The same PEP 625 metadata-directory rename as oslo.cache. Note that the glob in
the original does not save it: the wildcard is only on the version, so
"oslo.privsep-*.dist-info" still cannot match "oslo_privsep-3.10.1.dist-info".

diff -ur a/oslo-privsep/python-oslo-privsep.spec b/oslo-privsep/python-oslo-privsep.spec
--- a/python-oslo-privsep.spec	2026-09-28 17:09:11.595179514 +0000
+++ b/python-oslo-privsep.spec	2026-09-28 17:20:03.722411315 +0000
@@ -145,7 +145,7 @@
 %files -n python3-%{pkgname}
 %doc README.rst
 %{python3_sitelib}/oslo_privsep
-%{python3_sitelib}/%{pypi_name}-*.dist-info
+%{python3_sitelib}/%{tarsources}-*.dist-info
 %exclude %{python3_sitelib}/oslo_privsep/tests
 %{_bindir}/privsep-helper
 
